     }
    },
    {
     "id": "note",
     "set": {
      "text": "16 + 1 = 17"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "caption": "Result 0010001 = 17 = 84 − 67. Had there been no carry, the result would have been negative, with magnitude equal to the 1's complement of the sum.",
